[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2984082243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107654#issuecomment-2984082243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107654","id":2984082243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x3XtD","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T12:53:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T12:53:58Z","body":"Looks like Godot gets confused by the node having two \"icon\" properties, one from the `Button` itself and one from the script. It ends up making two initialization assignments to \"icon\", one with a copy of the other node and one with a node path reference. This causes the copy to be immediately orphaned.\n```\n[node name=\"IconButton\" type=\"Button\" parent=\".\" node_paths=PackedStringArray(\"icon\")]\nlayout_mode = 0\noffset_right = 8.0\noffset_bottom = 8.0\nicon = Object(TextureRect,[...])\n\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_ig7tw\")\nicon = NodePath(\"Icon\")\n```\n\nGDScript would usually prevent you from creating duplicate properties by giving a `Member \"icon\" redefined` error, but this can be circumvented by extending the script from a base class of the node and then redefining properties of the node's actual class in the script:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65e8bac9-e97d-4535-88b9-757bc54ac1b9)\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n@export var text: float\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d9acb0f-7c48-400e-b3ac-fe8fd0e5ebae)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2984082243/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6042620274","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107654#issuecomment-6042620274","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107654","id":6042620274,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaCsRcg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events